; Inventory positions keep the order they first appear in, and a position
; that sums to zero goes to the end when it comes back: AAPL is sold off
; and bought back, so it follows ZZZ.
2020-01-01 open Assets:Stock
2020-01-01 open Assets:Cash

2020-01-02 * "Buy"
  Assets:Stock   1 AAPL {150.00 USD}
  Assets:Stock   2 ZZZ {10.00 USD}
  Assets:Cash

2020-01-03 * "Sell all AAPL"
  Assets:Stock  -1 AAPL {150.00 USD}
  Assets:Cash

2020-01-04 * "Buy AAPL back"
  Assets:Stock   1 AAPL {150.00 USD}
  Assets:Cash
